WEBVTT

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.410
That idiot...

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.000
Look what happens when you get distracted.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.290
If it's Ilie, she's fine.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.000
They won't kill her.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.290
Did you withdraw last time
because Ilie was there?

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.790
What does it matter to you?

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.330
That's the insect cage's key.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.790
If you wanna see Ilie, come to 07.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.620
I'm Acht.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.700
The name of the punishment
that steals humanity.

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.450
This can't be...

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:37.790
Commander!

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:41.000
Hadi... Aisha...

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.040
What happened?

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.410
Commander refused to follow the order
to neutralize the Bazaar and...

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.200
The culprit behind this is
Area E Inspector-General Harb Adham.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:56.410
At this point in time, we will be taking
over the self-governing rights of E-05.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:57.870
Bazaar Overseer,

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:02.870
<i>from here on, I will</i>
<i>have you follow Salif Bakar's orders.</i>

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.620
You're saying you will break
the nonaggression pact?

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.450
Even if you hide behind a high wall,

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:12.000
the disease that haunts our kind
infects from within.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.040
Cagaster...

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.790
Even if we have to commit
an unforgivable sin,

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:21.290
now's the time for us
to take back the human world.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:26.000
For the foundation of my homeland, E-07!

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.790
So, it's begun...

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.790
Come on!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.160
-Dang!
-What are you doing?

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:47.290
I was wondering if there were any clues
to what happened to little Ilie.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.910
I searched through the stuff that we
picked up along with her and found that.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:55.580
There was a memory chip between the pages,

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.540
but I don't know the password.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:02.250
The hint is, "From this point,
give up your humanity."

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:04.370
Isn't it just "Cagaster"?

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.000
I tried that ages ago!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.830
"Give up your humanity"...

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.120
I'm Acht.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.660
The name of the punishment
that steals humanity.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:15.790
Reichs Acht?

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.200
The punishment to steal human rights...

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.040
Kidow! Bingo!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.000
<i>Franz...</i>

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:28.290
<i>I'm heading over to see you now.</i>

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.120
<i>To the place where you and Tania are.</i>

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.910
<i>If I don't make it there,</i>

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.290
<i>please...</i>

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:39.250
<i>listen to this as a friend's last will.</i>

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:55.580
Nice to meet you.
I've been newly transferred to 07...

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.290
It's going to rain.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.080
-And you are?
-Yes...

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.290
I'm your new assistant, Griffith,

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.040
Dr. Franz Chilio.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.580
Franz is fine.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.950
I was just about to have lunch.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.580
-Would you like to join?
-What?

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:28.790
Do you like it?

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.040
Yes!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.540
I think it's a magnificent research lab.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.290
If I study here,

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.830
maybe we can find a way
to heal cagasterized people...

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:40.330
-I was talking about my duck.
-What?

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.950
-Oh, yes. It's tasty!
-Glad to hear that.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.370
Cagaster Biological Laboratory.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.450
Within Area E,

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.910
it was the largest research lab
with the latest technology

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.200
and an enormous budget.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.120
Cagasters for military use?

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.330
Didn't you know?

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:06.450
I did hear there was a project
like that in the Far East.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.330
We're continuing that research here.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.910
Well, they failed in the Far East

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.700
and blew up with
the entire frontline base, though.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:19.000
<i>Despite being 21 years of age,</i>

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:23.200
<i>you inherited the studies of your father,</i>
<i>Emeth Chilio,</i>

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:26.000
<i>and completed the basis</i>
<i>of Cagaster research,</i>

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:28.910
<i>"Evolution to the Headless."</i>

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.540
Griffith!

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:37.200
In our next budget, can we request enough
to extend the pond?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.580
Please do that with your own salary.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.700
How much was my salary again?

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.660
<i>With you being younger than me,</i>

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.500
<i>at some point,</i>

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.580
<i>I started to think of you</i>
<i>as my little brother.</i>

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.080
Griffith lost his bet.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.950
I'm sorry to see you again.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.790
Why did you bring me here?

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.160
Take me back!

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.120
You turned two people into bugs.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:07.160
Do you really think things will stay
the way they were before?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.000
<i>Why did I forget...?</i>

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.250
<i>I'm home...</i>

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:30.700
<i>Mom...</i>

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.080
Franz!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.410
Franz!

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.080
You'll be late for the meeting!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:44.450
What?

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.080
Franz?

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:50.040
I'm sorry,

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.580
I completely forgot
the higher-ups were coming.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.250
Who's that girl?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.620
My little sister, Tania.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.330
You have a little sister?

00:07:58.750 --> 00:07:59.830
Isn't she beautiful?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.040
Don't worry, Griffith is a nice guy.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.160
Nice to meet you, Tania.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.120
The queen of the bugs
still hasn't been born?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.160
Because the biology of Cagasters
isn't completely clear yet.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:17.000
You said that you'd make
our wish come true.

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:22.250
His Excellency didn't pick up
and raise you and Tania out of charity.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:25.830
Picked up?

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:30.120
Seven years ago, when the frontline base
in the Far East blew up in an accident,

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.830
General Adham was the one
who took Tania and me in.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:37.910
Are you seriously trying to make
Cagasters into a weapon, too?

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.370
Of course not!

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:43.450
My dad only wished
for the Cagaster's raw truth.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.080
I want to find out what is breaking

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:49.620
within the human body
and what is trying to be born.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.660
<i>You said you wanted to know the truth.</i>

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.160
<i>After hearing those words,</i>
<i>I made up my mind...</i>

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.500
<i>to walk beside you.</i>

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.450
<i>Looking back now,</i>

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.580
<i>I shudder</i>
<i>at the horrifying things I've done.</i>

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.450
<i>What Emeth Chilio found out was</i>

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.450
<i>that Cagasters</i>
<i>were just like ants and bees.</i>

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:17.200
<i>That they were controlled by a queen.</i>

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.950
<i>If we could create the queen</i>
<i>with our hands,</i>

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.870
<i>we could stop the bugs</i>
<i>from attacking humans.</i>

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.250
<i>That's what we thought.</i>

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.250
<i>That's why we took</i> <i>numerous eggs</i>
<i>of the bugs...</i>

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.580
<i>No, not bugs.</i>

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:33.080
<i>We desecrated human eggs,</i>

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:36.870
<i>and threw out the deformed lives</i>
<i>as we created them.</i>

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:43.120
<i>Without realizing at all what this</i>
<i>experiment would bring in the end...</i>

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:47.750
<i>The deterioration of my morality</i>

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:51.450
<i>was enough to nearly</i>
<i>put out the fire within me.</i>

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:54.620
Why not quit if you don't like it?

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.910
Tania, you hate me, don't you?

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.910
I don't exactly hate you.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.950
But I don't like you, either.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.290
You only like your brother, huh?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.160
I don't hate him.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:11.410
As long as I continue to have Franz,
I don't need anything else.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.620
You sure do love your brother.
You'll never get a boyfriend.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.330
Franz isn't my brother.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:24.410
Emeth Chilio found a nearly
cagasterized woman's corpse.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.370
There was a child in her stomach.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.620
That child was me.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.830
I was born from a dead Cagaster's stomach.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.120
That's why I'm not related by blood
to Franz.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.250
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:43.910
Why...?

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.160
Tania, what'd you do that for?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.540
He bullied you, Franz.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:50.700
Bully?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:57.370
When anyone finds out about her birth,
they get creeped out and stay away.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:00.950
I thought it'd be sad
if you reacted that way, too.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:06.160
I wouldn't judge people based
on something like that.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.200
I think of you guys as friends.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.540
-Friends...
-What are friends?

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:14.620
It means that I'm on your side.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.370
<i>Two years later,</i>

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.160
<i>if I'm reminiscing about those days,</i>

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:25.870
<i>does that mean my senses</i>
<i>are still numb till this day?</i>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.750
With only the genetic information
from Tania's unfertilized egg,

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.620
we were able to finally get here.

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:35.250
The first ever Cagaster
we have given birth to.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:36.950
Specimen No. 8, huh?

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.290
Let's give it a name.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:40.910
That sounds nice.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.700
<i>The one who appears human,</i>

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:46.120
<i>yet cannot be bestowed human rights.</i>

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.750
<i>We named that child...</i>

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.080
<i>"Acht."</i>

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:02.790
It's been a while.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:05.950
You won't show me your face?

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.700
Most of the human parts aren't left.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:14.330
The only ones who know this face
are Franz and your Exterminator.

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:17.000
You worried about him?

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:21.700
Did you think things would end nicely
if you just came quietly?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.700
If that's the case,
it had the opposite effect.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.790
You'll be able to see hell soon.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:31.080
What do you think a human who's guaranteed

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.040
never to have a Cagaster outbreak
would want next?

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:40.370
I hear the girl
has sniffed out two bugs already.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.040
If the power grows by each generation,

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:49.410
maybe your father's argument
wasn't exactly wrong.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:54.450
"Whoever believes in their own innocence
is cruel against another's crime."

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:59.000
I remember talking about that
with a friend long ago.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.160
Griffith, eh?

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:05.830
However, this is my fate
as well as my mission.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:10.080
<i>Once Salif takes over</i>
<i>E-05's control tower,</i>

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:12.660
<i>we'll begin the "Trial."</i>

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:24.660
Deep sea fish?

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.500
Fish that can only live
at the bottom of the sea.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.160
They die if they come near the surface.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.500
Normally, they're creatures
that we'd never meet.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.790
<i>Acht,</i>

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.290
<i>my twin with whom I've shared my genes.</i>

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:50.410
<i>You must be suffering.</i>

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:53.040
<i>Just like me...</i>

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.700
He won't get attacked?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.250
Cagasters do not attack their own kind.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.040
It must have identified him
as one of them.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.410
Can it be used as the queen?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.250
Unfortunately, he is a boy.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:21.620
If he can't control the bugs,
then there's no point.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.250
Happy Birthday, Acht!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:30.160
What's this?

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.040
The story of the shepherd, Bo Peep.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.500
<i>Little Bo Peep</i>

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:39.040
<i>Has lost her sheep</i>

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.410
Hey, hey!

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:47.160
<i>Research finally began</i>
<i>to progress thanks to Acht,</i>

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.660
<i>who had inherited Tania's genes.</i>

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:52.620
<i>Tania's strange birth...</i>

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.040
<i>Her mother, who had a Cagaster</i>
<i>outbreak while pregnant,</i>

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.540
<i>ending up brain dead...</i>

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.790
<i>What Emeth Chilio unraveled</i>

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:04.540
<i>and whether or not</i>
<i>he closed in on the truth...</i>

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:08.200
<i>If only I knew all that at the time...</i>

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:10.410
You're getting married?

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.790
Tania says she wants to as well.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:16.080
Besides, I'm already 27 now, you know?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.160
I'm over 30 and still single here.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:23.870
Well, I'm really glad. Congrats!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.410
Thank you.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:28.870
<i>Soon after,</i>

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.870
<i>Tania gave birth to a girl.</i>

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:32.830
<i>She had silver hair</i>

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.290
<i>and purple-gray eyes just like Franz.</i>

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.370
<i>That child was named after</i>
<i>the counterpart of Cagaster,</i>

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.250
<i>Iliaster, which means the origin of life.</i>

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:45.160
<i>She was named Ilie.</i>

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:51.950
Acht, she's your little sister!

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:53.500
-No, she isn't.
-No, she isn't.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:55.410
Don't you both deny it so coldly.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:01.120
Can I ask you one thing?

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.580
If you can't tell me, that's fine.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.870
You two tied the knot

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.450
because you both wanted that, right?

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:13.290
You are truly on our side, huh?

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.080
I was afraid of you.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.950
Franz always seemed like he was having fun
when he was with you,

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.080
so I thought you'd take him away
from me one day.

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.370
I wouldn't take him.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.120
I'm a guy!

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.040
When we got around
to talking about children,

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.120
I wished for Franz.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.540
I thought that he would
become mine that way...

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:40.000
But that wasn't good enough.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.830
I had put Franz into a box

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.370
and destroyed his life.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:52.660
Right when you opened the doors
and showed him the world outside.

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:54.620
Tania...

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:56.660
Please remember this...

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.410
I'm a monster born from a Cagaster,

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.120
but when I wished for this child,

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:06.910
I was just a selfish and jealous woman.

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.540
This child's mother was definitely human.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:17.540
Looks like he's using
his little sister for the experiment.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:21.000
That's his wife now, right?
He's gonna make that his guinea pig?

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:23.540
What a true academic.

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:26.000
There's a spare queen now.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:28.040
Looks like you're useless, then.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:31.620
How do you feel,
slowly turning into a bug?

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:34.950
You are indeed a failure!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.080
Are you serious?

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:43.450
We couldn't create a queen in the end.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.160
That's why we'll use Tania
like how my dad used

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:50.160
-the queen that gave birth to her...
-You're gonna sacrifice Tania?!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.910
I don't mind.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.160
If that's what Franz wants.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.580
<i>Just as Emeth Chilio did,</i>

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.000
<i>we cut open Tania.</i>

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.540
<i>For the Cagaster's truth</i>

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.790
<i>and for the salvation of the human world.</i>

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:15.790
<i>That's what we said and...</i>

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:20.330
Don't eat that.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.450
That's not food.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.540
That's a flower.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.700
What's a flower?

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:26.830
What?

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.040
Mom! Mom!

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.290
What's a flower?

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.750
"Forget-me-not."

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:43.790
"A flower is an organ of plants

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:48.500
that attracts insects as catalysts
in passing their seeds on," she says.

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:51.120
When is Mom coming out?

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.410
I want her to read me a book!

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:55.040
That's not possible.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:57.250
If Tania leaves this place...

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:59.450
Then I'll go in, too!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:02.200
Mom, let me in! Mom!

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.870
-Ilie will go in, too!
-Stop!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.540
Mom, let me in, too!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:12.540
<i>Acht,</i> <i>if you haven't decided</i>
<i>where you are going,</i>

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:17.120
<i>please take my place</i>
<i>for her for a little while.</i>

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.160
<i>That year,</i>

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.290
<i>Tania entered the cocoon</i>
<i>in a state of sleep...</i>

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:28.000
<i>never to awaken again.</i>

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.290
<i>And in return for her sacrifice,</i>

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:34.950
<i>we were able to fulfill</i>
<i>our greatest desire.</i>

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.410
Could this be...

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.790
"Stand back and bow down."

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:46.830
We gave out an order by adjusting
a constant wave flowing from Tania.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.410
Saying that this, here, is your queen.

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.120
Well done.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:57.410
"There she espied their tails
side by side,

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:59.250
-all hung on a tree to dry."
<i>-Tania,</i>

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:01.870
<i>we can control the Cagasters</i>
<i>thanks to you.</i>

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:03.700
"And over the hillocks went rambling...

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.080
<i>Neither your daughter nor your twin</i>

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:09.580
<i>-will get hurt anymore.</i>
-...to tack each again to its lambkin."

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.250
<i>Even if that should come to pass,</i>

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.830
<i>I swear I'll protect them.</i>

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:17.830
-Hey, hey, read it one more time!
<i>-Not knowing anything,</i>

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.120
<i>that's what my stupid self swore</i>
<i>at that moment.</i>

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.000
<i>That's right.</i>

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:24.450
<i>I didn't know a thing.</i>

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.160
<i>I didn't know how terrifying it would be.</i>

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.330
<i>Thirty years have passed</i>
<i>since the outbreak of Cagasters.</i>

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.950
We have finally reached the day
when this is no longer a problem.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.410
Stop, Franz!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.410
Do you know what that's going to start?!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.790
Of course.

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:03.250
The origin of insect cages
will be exposed here today.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.910
The project to create the queen

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.410
will be completed with this success.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:12.450
Franz, I thought that
I could save the world

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:15.790
from Cagasters if I came close
to the truth that you spoke of.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.620
But I was a fool.

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:19.370
Cancel the project!

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.040
It's too late.

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:23.200
<i>The latent Cagaster genes</i>

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:27.580
<i>within people will respond</i>
<i>and wake up to the queen's voice.</i>

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:34.000
Now,<i> </i>you will all witness
the future of mankind!

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.040
It's time for the trial.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:52.660
<i>From a different standpoint,</i>
<i>people are sorted into "the evolved"</i>

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:56.000
<i>or "food" with the birth of the queen,</i>

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:58.700
<i>giving order to society.</i>

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.870
<i>My dad proved this in the Far East</i>

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:04.910
<i>and the city was completely devoured</i>
<i>by bugs.</i>

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:09.830
<i>Adham</i> <i>intends on controlling</i>
<i>the bugs better this time.</i>

00:22:10.950 --> 00:22:12.700
A world with only sorted people,

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:15.080
who have no fear of turning into bugs.

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:18.290
That is Adham's true goal.

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:23.250
But there's no guarantee children
born later won't become bugs!

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:26.370
That's why we prepared a spare queen.

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:29.290
"A spare," you say?

00:22:30.040 --> 00:22:31.870
That's your daughter!

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:33.040
Griffith!

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:34.790
Read me a book!

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:37.160
I can't find Acht today.

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.160
You sacrificed Tania...

00:22:42.660 --> 00:22:44.500
for this witch hunt?!

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:48.910
Neither me nor my dad was chosen
for the future.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:50.910
That day,

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:53.790
my dad was disappointed
that he couldn't become a bug...

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:57.080
<i>and he gave himself up to them.</i>

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:01.950
This is goodbye, Franz.

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:05.410
I won't let you make Ilie
into a tool, too.

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:06.950
It'll get lonely.

00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:10.450
Did you actually love Tania?

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:14.790
People use love
as an excuse to stop thinking.

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:17.950
It's almost as stupid
as talking about God.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:20.540
But...

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:25.870
because I had Tania,
I was able to survive these 20 years.

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:32.500
What were you gonna do if I had
a Cagaster outbreak in this spot?

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:36.120
I thought that wouldn't be bad, either.

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:38.750
If I could become
my friend's flesh and blood,

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:41.700
I'd feel like my life was worth something.

00:23:43.410 --> 00:23:45.080
Goodbye, Griffith.

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:51.660
<i>Let me warn you.</i>

00:23:52.540 --> 00:23:54.540
<i>The people who know they won't become bugs</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:56.040
<i>will fear others...</i>

00:23:56.370 --> 00:23:57.660
<i>and despise them.</i>

00:23:58.250 --> 00:24:00.750
<i>Griffith. You're the same.</i>

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:03.450
<i>Whoever believes in their own innocence</i>

00:24:03.700 --> 00:24:05.500
<i>is cruel against another's crime.</i>

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:08.080
<i>You can't turn back anymore.</i>

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:10.160
Acht!

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:12.200
Come here! Come with us!

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:13.910
Acht!

00:24:14.450 --> 00:24:16.120
What are you doing there?!

00:24:24.250 --> 00:24:27.040
You wanted a monster, right, human?

00:24:27.370 --> 00:24:28.500
Then I'll live up to it.

00:24:28.620 --> 00:24:32.000
I'm a predator that preys on you!

00:24:35.080 --> 00:24:36.330
Acht...

00:24:43.000 --> 00:24:43.910
Ilie...

00:24:49.290 --> 00:24:51.910
<i>Little Bo Peep</i>

00:24:52.290 --> 00:24:55.330
<i>Has lost her sheep</i>

00:24:55.790 --> 00:24:59.120
<i>And can't tell where</i>

00:24:59.200 --> 00:25:02.200
<i>To find them</i>

00:25:02.330 --> 00:25:04.790
Where did you learn that song?

00:25:04.870 --> 00:25:06.750
Acht taught me!

00:25:07.950 --> 00:25:10.330
<i>Little Bo Peep</i>

00:25:10.620 --> 00:25:13.450
<i>Has lost her sheep</i>

00:25:14.160 --> 00:25:17.910
<i>And can't tell where</i>

00:25:18.000 --> 00:25:20.790
<i>To find them</i>

00:25:22.370 --> 00:25:23.910
<i>In the village where we hid,</i>

00:25:24.660 --> 00:25:29.370
<i>young Ilie gradually forgot her longing</i>
<i>for her mom and Acht.</i>

00:25:30.750 --> 00:25:35.790
<i>The father-daughter role-play</i>
<i>soon became the truth inside Ilie.</i>

00:25:36.540 --> 00:25:38.290
<i>I was happy.</i>

00:25:39.160 --> 00:25:43.000
<i>I had dreams of living here</i>
<i>with you guys numerous times.</i>

00:25:45.750 --> 00:25:47.450
But that ends here.

00:25:49.580 --> 00:25:52.910
<i>Today, Ilie turned a human</i>

00:25:53.120 --> 00:25:54.450
<i>into a bug.</i>

00:25:55.830 --> 00:25:58.160
<i>It was just like you said, Franz.</i>

00:25:59.580 --> 00:26:02.660
<i>I had feared others up to this day.</i>

00:26:03.830 --> 00:26:06.410
<i>After saying that I'd save</i>
<i>the world from Cagasters,</i>

00:26:06.500 --> 00:26:07.910
<i>I couldn't do anything</i>

00:26:08.500 --> 00:26:10.830
<i>and triggered the worst scenario ever.</i>

00:26:12.580 --> 00:26:15.620
<i>If she can't live as a human, at least...</i>

00:26:16.540 --> 00:26:17.620
<i>At least...</i>

00:26:18.250 --> 00:26:20.660
<i>I must kill her with my own hands...</i>

00:26:22.250 --> 00:26:24.950
<i>But she calls me "Dad."</i>

00:26:26.750 --> 00:26:29.750
<i>The way she laughs</i>
<i>is exactly the same as you.</i>

00:26:33.080 --> 00:26:35.410
<i>I'll take any punishment,</i>

00:26:35.790 --> 00:26:39.120
<i>so I beg you please, Franz!</i>

00:26:39.870 --> 00:26:42.000
<i>Save our daughter!</i>
